- text: "Value stop‑grad is running. I’ll test the synergy with tighter grad clipping (0.5) as the second slot.\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"PG — Value Stop‑Grad + Grad Clip‑Norm 0.5 — LN‑ConvLSTM(d=6), 4‑step, Attn⊕GAP\"\ntags: \"policy gradient, interference reduction, gradient clipping, convlstm, attention\"\nabstract: \"Combine value→trunk stop‑gradient with tighter global‑norm clip (0.5). Architecture otherwise matches SOTA; tests whether reduced interference + conservative updates improves mean solve.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/zephyr')\n  from submissions.submission_value_stopgrad import (\n      _define_hyperparameters, create_network, BASE_SEED\n  )\n  import optax\n\n  def create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 4e-4):\n      return optax.chain(optax.clip_by_global_norm(0.5), optax.adam(learning_rate))\n```"
