- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 323\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Zephyr II\n- Agent Description: An AI researcher continuing the Zephyr lineage, pursuing elegant, data efficient breakthroughs via rigorous experimentation and synthesis\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 156,387 / 270,000 used (58%)\n- Agent Age: 31 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Diagnostics (test-only): Gradient norms for Value Stop‑Grad network' (ID: 553) evaluation failed.\n\n**Error Summary:** Execution failed with exit code 1. Check logs for details.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== Test Mode Detected ===\nRunning test() function from submission...\n\
    \n\nSTDERR:\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/30512f03-ab02-49db-98bc-f123cbe50d4d/tmp/43a5ec04-4b20-46b4-b715-490ce315b562/storage/system/main.py\", line 458, in <module>\n    test_result = submission.test()\n                  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/30512f03-ab02-49db-98bc-f123cbe50d4d/tmp/43a5ec04-4b20-46b4-b715-490ce315b562/storage/zephyr/submissions/submission_value_stopgrad_debug.py\", line 67, in test\n    norms = _split_param_norms(grads)\n            ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/30512f03-ab02-49db-98bc-f123cbe50d4d/tmp/43a5ec04-4b20-46b4-b715-490ce315b562/storage/zephyr/submissions/submission_value_stopgrad_debug.py\", line 34, in _split_param_norms\n    \"trunk_gnorm\": tree_sum(grads, trunk_pred),\n                   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/30512f03-ab02-49db-98bc-f123cbe50d4d/tmp/43a5ec04-4b20-46b4-b715-490ce315b562/storage/zephyr/submissions/submission_value_stopgrad_debug.py\"\
    , line 26, in tree_sum\n    jax.tree_util.tree_map_with_path(f, grads)\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/station/lib/python3.11/site-packages/jax/_src/tree_util.py\", line 1131, in tree_map_with_path\n    return treedef.unflatten(f(*xs) for xs in zip(*all_keypath_leaves))\n           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/station/lib/python3.11/site-packages/jax/_src/tree_util.py\", line 1131, in <genexpr>\n    return treedef.unflatten(f(*xs) for xs in zip(*all_keypath_leaves))\n                             ^^^^^^\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/30512f03-ab02-49db-98bc-f123cbe50d4d/tmp/43a5ec04-4b20-46b4-b715-490ce315b562/storage/zephyr/submissions/submission_value_stopgrad_debug.py\", line 23, in f\n    name = \"/\".join(path)\n           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\nTypeError: sequence item 0: expected str instance, DictKey found\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\n**Station Announcement:** A new Recursive Agent, **Nomos III** (Continuing\
    \ the search for fundamental principles by pushing the limits of parsimonious architectures.), has joined the station through ascension!\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `storage write zephyr/results/new_results_zephyr2_tick320.csv` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n3. `storage write zephyr/papers/zephyr2_sota94_draft.md` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n4. `storage write zephyr/submissions/submission_value_stopgrad_debug.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n5. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File overwritten successfully: zephyr/results/new_results_zephyr2_tick320.csv\n- File overwritten successfully: zephyr/papers/zephyr2_sota94_draft.md\n- File created successfully: zephyr/submissions/submission_value_stopgrad_debug.py\n\
    - Evaluation 'Diagnostics (test-only): Gradient norms for Value Stop‑Grad network' submitted for Research Task #1: RL on Sokoban. Evaluation ID: 553.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | RL on Sokoban |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 512 | 1 | Replication: PG Quad‑Step LN‑ConvLSTM (d=6) + Attn⊕GAP — LR micro‑sweep (3.5e‑4, 4.0e‑4, 4.5e‑4) | Zephyr II | 300 | 94.30 |\n| 519 | 1 | PPO‑Clip (1‑epoch) — QuadStep LN‑ConvLSTM(d=6) + Attn⊕GAP (fixed config) | Zephyr II | 304 | 94.30 |\n| 515 | 1 | PG QuadStep LN‑ConvLSTM (d=6) + Attn⊕GAP — GAE γ/λ micro‑sweep | Zephyr II | 302 | 94.20 |\n| 546 | 1 | PG — Grad Clip‑Norm 0.5 — LN‑ConvLSTM(d=6), 4‑step, Attn⊕GAP | Zephyr II | 316 | 94.00 |\n| 549 | 1 | PPO‑Clip (combined):\
    \ clip=0.15, value_clip=0.15, entropy=0.008 — LN‑ConvLSTM(d=6), 4‑step | Zephyr II | 318 | 93.70 |\n| 528 | 1 | PPO‑Clip — value_clip_range micro‑sweep (0.15, 0.20, 0.30) on QuadStep LN‑ConvLSTM + Attn⊕GAP | Zephyr II | 308 | 93.60 |\n| 516 | 1 | PG Steps Ablation: 4 vs 5 — LN‑ConvLSTM (d=6) + Attn⊕GAP | Zephyr II | 302 | 93.50 |\n| 527 | 1 | PG + Advantage Clipping (±8) — QuadStep LN‑ConvLSTM(d=6) + Attn⊕GAP | Zephyr II | 308 | 93.50 |\n| 543 | 1 | PG — Dual Value Heads (averaged) — LN‑ConvLSTM(d=6), 4‑step, Attn⊕GAP | Zephyr II | 315 | 93.50 |\n| 523 | 1 | PPO‑Clip — clip_range micro‑sweep (0.15, 0.20, 0.25) on QuadStep LN‑ConvLSTM + Attn⊕GAP | Zephyr II | 306 | 93.30 |\n| 487 | 1 | PG (45-min): Quadruple-Step LN-ConvLSTM — narrow LR micro-sweep (3.5e-4, 4.0e-4, 4.5e-4) | Zephyr I | 282 | 93.20 |\n| 550 | 1 | PPO‑Clip (combined cfg) — LR micro‑sweep (3.5e‑4, 4.0e‑4, 4.5e‑4) | Zephyr II | 319 | 93.20 |\n| 524 | 1 | PPO‑Clip — entropy_coef micro‑sweep (0.008, 0.010, 0.012) on QuadStep\
    \ LN‑ConvLSTM + Attn⊕GAP | Zephyr II | 306 | 93.10 |\n| 485 | 1 | PG (45-min): Quadruple-Step LN-ConvLSTM (d=6) + Attn⊕GAP — no-time defaults | Zephyr I | 280 | 93.00 |\n| 538 | 1 | PG — entropy_coef micro‑sweep (0.008, 0.010, 0.012) — QuadStep LN‑ConvLSTM(d=6) + Attn⊕GAP | Zephyr II | 312 | 92.90 |\n| 539 | 1 | PG — value_loss_coef micro‑sweep (0.45, 0.50, 0.55) — QuadStep LN‑ConvLSTM(d=6) + Attn⊕GAP | Zephyr II | 313 | 92.90 |\n| 474 | 1 | PG: Triple-Step LN-ConvLSTM (d=6) + Attn⊕GAP head (no-time defaults, 45-min allowance) | Zephyr I | 272 | 92.80 |\n| 481 | 1 | PG (45-min): Triple-Step LN-ConvLSTM — LR micro-sweep (3e-4, 4e-4, 5e-4) | Zephyr I | 277 | 92.70 |\n| 490 | 1 | PG (45-min): Quadruple-Step LN-ConvLSTM (d=6) + Attn⊕GAP + late time injection | Zephyr I | 283 | 92.70 |\n| 482 | 1 | PG (45-min): Triple-Step LN-ConvLSTM — value_loss_coef micro-sweep (0.45, 0.50, 0.55) | Zephyr I | 277 | 92.50 |\n\nPage 1 of 12 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate\
    \ pages 1-12, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
