parts:
- text: "Consolidating for analysis and reproducibility. I’ll add a shared probe schema aligned with Aether, a brief ablation summary, and a reproduction checklist for our 94.3 baseline.\n\n`/execute_action{storage write zephyr/probes/phase_probe_schema.json}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  {\n    \"$schema\": \"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\n    \"title\": \"Phase Probe Schema (R_vp, attention, LN gates)\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n      \"task\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"e.g., Sokoban_8x8\" },\n      \"arch\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"LN-ConvLSTM(64), 4-step, Attn⊕GAP\" },\n      \"algo\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"PG | PPO-Clip\" },\n      \"seed\": { \"type\": \"integer\" },\n      \"phases\": {\n        \"type\": \"array\",\n        \"items\": {\n          \"type\": \"object\",\n          \"properties\": {\n            \"phase_name\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"init\", \"early\", \"mid\"\
    , \"late\"] },\n            \"update_index\": { \"type\": \"integer\" },\n            \"num_updates_total\": { \"type\": \"integer\" },\n            \"rvp_ratio\": { \"type\": \"number\", \"description\": \"||∇_trunk L_value|| / ||∇_trunk L_policy||\" },\n            \"grad_trunk_value\": { \"type\": \"number\" },\n            \"grad_trunk_policy\": { \"type\": \"number\" },\n            \"attn_entropy_mean_norm\": { \"type\": \"number\" },\n            \"attn_max_mean\": { \"type\": \"number\" },\n            \"ln_gate_stats\": {\n              \"type\": \"object\",\n              \"properties\": {\n                \"mean\": { \"type\": \"number\" },\n                \"var\": { \"type\": \"number\" }\n              },\n              \"required\": [\"mean\", \"var\"]\n            }\n          },\n          \"required\": [\"phase_name\", \"update_index\", \"num_updates_total\", \"rvp_ratio\", \"grad_trunk_value\", \"grad_trunk_policy\", \"attn_entropy_mean_norm\", \"attn_max_mean\", \"\
    ln_gate_stats\"]\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"required\": [\"task\", \"arch\", \"algo\", \"seed\", \"phases\"]\n  }\n```\n\n`/execute_action{storage write zephyr/results/ablation_summary_tick330.md}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Ablation Summary (Tick 330)\n  - Baseline parity (capacity-matched): PG and PPO-Clip both 94.3 mean (IDs 512, 519).\n  - PG grad-clip: 0.5 → 94.0 (ID 546); 2.0 → 92.4 (ID 547). Default 1.0 remains best.\n  - GAE(γ,λ): neutral around (0.97,0.97) (ID 515).\n  - PPO value_clip & clip ranges: best means < 94.3 (IDs 528, 523, 549, 550).\n  - Steps: 5-step underperforms 4-step (ID 516).\n  - Architectural tweaks: attention temperature and split aggregators regress (IDs 534, 533).\n  - Value→trunk stop-grad: complete collapse (ID 551). Env-based gradients show strong trunk grads; removal likely harms feature shaping under budget.\n  Takeaway: Architecture dominates under the 45-min/seed constraint; parsimony and default training settings are robust.\n```\n\n`/execute_action{storage\
    \ write zephyr/results/README_reproduction.md}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Reproducing 94.3% Baseline (4 seeds, 45 min/seed)\n  Setup: Use Research Counter; submit the provided wrappers.\n  1) PG Baseline (ID 512 equivalent)\n     - Submission file: storage/zephyr/submissions/submission_sota.py\n     - Fixed: BASE_SEED=42, Adam(lr=4e-4), GAE(0.97/0.97), grad-clip=1.0.\n  2) PPO-Clip Baseline (ID 519 equivalent)\n     - Submission file: storage/zephyr/submissions/submission_ppo_clip.py\n     - One epoch per rollout; clip=0.2, value_clip=0.2; lr=4e-4.\n\n  Notes\n  - Final score is mean solve across 4 seeds (BASE_SEED + {0,1,2,3}).\n  - Each run auto-times out around 45 minutes/seed; allow up to 2 ticks for completion.\n  - Use storage/zephyr/results/zephyr2_results_table.md as reference for expected means/stds.\n```"
