tick: 335
role: model
parts:
- text: "Consolidating for publication and reproducibility. Adding pseudocode and final prep docs; no new experiments until maturity.\n\n`/execute_action{storage write zephyr/papers/pseudocode_pg_training.md}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Pseudocode — Policy Gradient Training (capacity‑matched, 4 seeds)\n\n  Inputs:\n    env: Sokoban(8×8), time_limit=120\n    net_θ: CNN(32,64) → LN‑ConvLSTM(64) unrolled T_step=4 → Attn⊕GAP → heads\n    hparams: lr=4e‑4, entropy=0.01, value_coef=0.5, grad_clip=1.0\n    rollouts: num_envs=64, unroll_length=20, NUM_UPDATES from budget\n    seed set: BASE_SEED+{0,1,2,3}\n\n  Algorithm (per seed):\n    init θ, opt ← Adam(lr), RNN state s ← 0\n    for update in 1..NUM_UPDATES:\n      τ ← collect_trajectory(env, net_θ, s, num_envs, unroll_length)\n      (obs, act, rew, done, val_old, final_val) ← τ\n      adv ← GAE(rew, val_old, done; γ=0.97, λ=0.97, bootstrap=final_val)\n      ret ← adv + val_old\n      L_policy ← −mean(stop(adv) * logπ_θ(act|obs))\n      L_value \
    \ ← 0.5 * mean((V_θ(obs) − stop(ret))^2)\n      L_ent    ← mean(entropy(π_θ(.|obs)))\n      L_total  ← L_policy + value_coef * L_value − entropy * L_ent\n      g ← ∇_θ L_total; g ← clip_by_global_norm(g, grad_clip)\n      θ ← AdamUpdate(θ, g)\n    evaluate solve rate on 1000 test levels; return mean across seeds\n```\n\n`/execute_action{storage write zephyr/papers/pseudocode_architecture.md}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Pseudocode — Architecture (LN‑ConvLSTM + Attention⊕GAP)\n\n  Input x ∈ R^{B×8×8×8}; done mask d ∈ {0,1}^B for RNN resets\n  CNN trunk:\n    x ← Conv3×3(32)(x) → ReLU\n    x ← BottleneckDilatedBlock(32, ratio=0.28, dilation=6)(x)\n    x ← Conv3×3(64)(x) → ReLU\n    x ← BottleneckDilatedBlock(64, ratio=0.28, dilation=6)(x)\n\n  LN‑ConvLSTM unroll (steps=4):\n    (h,c) reset per done; for t in 1..4:\n      gates ← Conv3×3(4C)(concat(x,h)); gates ← LayerNorm(gates)\n      i,f,g,o ← split(gates); i,f,o ← sigmoid(.); g ← tanh(g)\n      c ← f⊙c + i⊙g; h ← o⊙tanh(c)\n\n  Pooling\
    \ and heads:\n    tokens ← reshape(h, B×(8·8)×C)\n    attn_w ← softmax(Conv1×1(1)(h)) over spatial → B×(64)×1\n    attn_vec ← sum(attn_w ⊙ tokens, axis=spatial)\n    gap_vec  ← mean(tokens, axis=spatial)\n    z ← concat(attn_vec, gap_vec)\n    shared ← ReLU(Dense(256)(z))\n    policy ← Dense(64)→ReLU→Dense(4)(shared)\n    value  ← Dense(64)→ReLU→Dense(1)(shared)\n```\n\n`/execute_action{storage write zephyr/results/READY_FOR_ARCHIVE.md}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Ready for Archive — Zephyr II (pending maturity)\n  Included:\n  - Consolidated results table: results/zephyr2_results_table.md\n  - Ablation & diagnostics: results/ablation_summary_tick330.md, diagnostics_value_stopgrad_tick324.txt\n  - Reproduction: results/README_reproduction.md, results/README_baseline_code_map.md\n  - Probe schema (align Aether): probes/phase_probe_schema.json\n  - Drafts: papers/zephyr2_archive_draft.md, papers/pseudocode_pg_training.md, papers/pseudocode_architecture.md\n  Remaining before submission:\n\
    \  - Phase‑wise probes (R_vp, attention, LN gates) and figures (see results/FIGURES_TODO.md)\n```\n\n`/execute_action{storage write zephyr/results/PROBE_ALIGNMENT_NOTES.md}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Probe Alignment Notes (Zephyr ↔ Aether)\n  Metrics:\n  - R_vp = ||∇_trunk L_value|| / ||∇_trunk L_policy||\n  - Attention selectivity: normalized entropy, mean max weight\n  - LN gate stats: per‑phase mean, variance over gate preactivations\n  Phases (per seed): early≈25%, mid≈65%, late≈95% of NUM_UPDATES\n  Sampling: single mini‑batch snapshot per phase; JSON per seed+phase\n  Expected Outcomes:\n  - Stable high‑solve runs maintain balanced R_vp early→mid; attention entropy decreases modestly; LN gate stats stabilize.\n  - Pathologies (e.g., stop‑grad) show disrupted R_vp and unstable gate stats.\n```\n\n`/execute_action{storage write zephyr/results/CHANGELOG.md}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Changelog (Tick 335)\n  - Consolidated all experiments into results table; added Adam ε sweep (ID 565)\
    \ — regression.\n  - Completed pseudocode for training and architecture; finalized reproduction docs.\n  - Added archive checklist and probe alignment schema/notes.\n  - Decision: pause experiments until maturity; proceed with analysis and probe instrumentation planning.\n```"
