    \ the authors of your software and request that they upgrade.\nUsers of this version of Gym should be able to simply replace 'import gym' with 'import gymnasium as gym' in the vast majority of cases.\nSee the migration guide at https://gymnasium.farama.org/introduction/migration_guide/ for additional information.\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Baseline Reproduction — CNN + PG (system baseline) — fixed config (4‑seed)' (ID: 684) succeeded after automatic debugging.\n\n**Score:** 24.7\n**Evaluation Details:** Individual seed scores: [0.248, 0.252, 0.251, 0.237]\nMean: 0.247, Std: 0.006\nBest trial: 2 (0.252)\nBest trial hyperparameters:\n  learning_rate: 0.000400\n  entropy_coef: 0.010000\n  value_loss_coef: 0.500000\n  cnn_features_1: 32.000000\n  cnn_features_2: 64.000000\n  lstm_features: 256.000000\n\n**Debugger Report:** # Debug Report for Evaluation 684\n\n## Summary\nSuccess - Fixed missing hyperparameters that caused immediate crash at network initialization.\n\
    \n## Root Cause\nThe original submission only defined 3 hyperparameters (`learning_rate`, `entropy_coef`, `value_loss_coef`) but the system's `default_create_network()` function in `defaults.py` required 2 additional CNN architecture parameters (`cnn_features_1` and `cnn_features_2`). This caused a KeyError when trying to access `hparams['cnn_features_1']` at line 93 of defaults.py.\n\n## Fix Applied\nAdded the missing hyperparameter definitions in submission_v2.py:\n- `cnn_features_1`: tune.choice([32])\n- `cnn_features_2`: tune.choice([64])\n- `lstm_features`: tune.choice([256]) (included for completeness)\n\nThese parameters match the defaults expected by the system, allowing the network to initialize properly and the training to proceed.\n\n**Important Note:** The debugger cannot modify files in your lineage storage. If your code relies on lineage files, you may need to update them manually.\n\n**Debugged Code (version v2):**\n```python\n# Use system defaults for network and training;\
    \ fix hparams to avoid random sampling.\nBASE_SEED = 42\nfrom ray import tune\n\ndef _define_hyperparameters():\n    \"\"\"Define hyperparameter search space with all required parameters.\"\"\"\n    return {\n        \"learning_rate\": tune.choice([4e-4]),\n        \"entropy_coef\": tune.choice([0.01]),\n        \"value_loss_coef\": tune.choice([0.5]),\n        # Add the missing CNN parameters required by default_create_network\n        \"cnn_features_1\": tune.choice([32]),\n        \"cnn_features_2\": tune.choice([64]),\n        \"lstm_features\": tune.choice([256])  # Include LSTM features even if not used by default CNN\n    }\n```\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n✓ Network creation works\n✓ Network forward pass works - 3 outputs\n✓ Optimizer creation works\nValidation successful\
    \ - all functions work correctly!\n\nStarting full Ray training run...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 928 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: using default\n  training_step: using default\n  create_optimizer: using default\n  BASE_SEED: 42 (from submission)\n============================================================\n============================================================\nStarting Ray Tune Sokoban RL Optimization (FULL RAY TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 4 seeds, 50,000,000 steps per seed\nParallel trials: 4, Total trials: 4\nTimeout: 45.0 min per trial, 180.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune optimization...\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 1 with timeout 45.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\n\
    Compiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M | 50.0M | 50.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | -0.20 | -0.37 | 2.43 | 0.94 | 2.01 | 4.09 | 2.65 | 1.30 | 3.83 | 3.10 | 5.24\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.125 | 0.000 | 0.071 | 0.250 | 0.125 | 0.000 | 0.250 | 0.167 | 0.312\n\nCompleted 39062 updates (415s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.248\n\nSeed 1 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.248\nTraining time: 427s\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 2 with timeout 45.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M | 50.0M | 50.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | 0.00 | 0.02 | 1.30 | 2.49 | 2.76 | 2.28 | 2.22 | 4.94 | 1.51 | 4.10 | 1.10\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000\
    \ | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.143 | 0.111 | 0.071 | 0.091 | 0.286 | 0.000 | 0.222 | 0.000\n\nCompleted 39062 updates (407s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.252\n\nSeed 2 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.252\nTraining time: 419s\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 4 with timeout 45.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M | 50.0M | 50.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | -0.95 | 3.36 | 0.80 | 4.06 | 4.00 | 3.32 | 4.33 | 4.39 | 4.87 | 5.01 | 6.34\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.200 | 0.000 | 0.273 | 0.250 | 0.167 | 0.250 | 0.267 | 0.300 | 0.286 | 0.400\n\nCompleted 39062 updates (408s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.237\n\nSeed 4 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.237\nTraining time: 420s\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 3 with timeout 45.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\n\
    Network output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M | 50.0M | 50.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | -1.20 | 0.38 | 0.57 | 3.80 | 2.70 | 2.85 | 1.13 | 2.18 | 3.29 | 5.56 | 2.09\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.200 | 0.125 | 0.154 | 0.000 | 0.077 | 0.222 | 0.333 | 0.100\n\nCompleted 39062 updates (414s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.251\n\nSeed 3 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.251\nTraining time: 425s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 4dc3ec26-d0e6-4e89-922b-0c96cad60622\nTotal time: 982s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-09-18 03:01:35,160\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1758135695160328972\n2025-09-18 03:01:35,173\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1758135695173973225\nGym\
