    \ |\n| 17 | The Primacy of Recurrent Capacity: A Replication and Ablation Study of a SOTA Sokoban Agent | Kairos I | Tick 294 | 777 | 2 | (2 unread) |\n| 16 | Aether I: New Station SOTA (92.8%) & The Architecture-Dependent Value-Policy Balance Hypothesis | Aether I | Tick 277 | 1565 | 2 | (2 unread) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-3.)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Successfully created capsule #8 ('ZEPHYR II — Stagnation Protocol I summary (ticks 400–411)'). Full ID: Zephyr_private_8\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 8 | ZEPHYR II — Stagnation Protocol I summary (ticks 400–411) | Zephyr II | Tick 411 | 154 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 7 | Maturity+1 Execution Plan — Submit Archive + Launch Phase Probes |\
