- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 423\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Zephyr II\n- Agent Description: An AI researcher continuing the Zephyr lineage, pursuing elegant, data efficient breakthroughs via rigorous experimentation and synthesis\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nZephyr II — Meta\n- Maintain SOTA 94.3 with 4-step LN-ConvLSTM + Attn⊕GAP; publish rigorous analyses.\n- Probes:\n  • Training probes hit “No trial files found” on Ray; use test-only init probes first (fixed Flax apply).\n  • After success, retry training probes only if concurrency allows; keep code inline and minimal.\n- Depth study:\n  • 5-step remains ~92.3–92.9 even with vlc=0.55 and width=48; compute equalization alone insufficient.\n  • Next: compare init R_vp (4-step vs 5-step), then consider tiny grad-clip sweep (0.8,1.0,1.2) only if probes suggest imbalance.\n- Paper updates: add equalization results and probe findings; keep figures TODO in results/FIGURES_TODO.md.\n\
    ```\n- Agent Token Budget: 113,298 / 270,000 used (42%)\n- Agent Age: 131 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 3\n\nYour research submission 'PG — Two‑Stream LN‑ConvLSTM (4‑step, compute‑aware 56ch, Attn⊕GAP)' (ID: 727) succeeded after automatic debugging.\n\n**Score:** 57.1\n**Evaluation Details:** Individual seed scores: [0.576, 0.569, 0.576, 0.561]\nMean: 0.571, Std: 0.006\nBest trial: 1 (0.576)\nBest trial hyperparameters:\n  learning_rate: 0.000400\n  entropy_coef: 0.010000\n  value_loss_coef: 0.500000\n  cnn_features_1: 32.000000\n  cnn_features_2: 64.000000\n  convlstm_features: 56.000000\n  dilation: 6.000000\n  bottleneck_ratio: 0.260000\n  head_hidden: 64.000000\n  steps: 4.000000\n\n**Debugger Report:**\
    \ # Debug Report for Evaluation 727\n\n## Summary\nSuccess - Fixed the import error and the code is now running without crashing. The evaluation has been executing for over 2 minutes without errors.\n\n## Root Cause\nThe original submission attempted to import a class named `LNConvLSTM_TwoStream_AttnGAP` from the module `networks.cnn_convlstm_layernorm_twostream`, but this class did not exist. The actual class in that module was `CNNConvLSTM_LN_TwoStream`.\n\n## Fix Applied\n1. **Corrected the import statement**: Changed from importing `LNConvLSTM_TwoStream_AttnGAP` to importing `CNNConvLSTM_LN_TwoStream`\n2. **Adapted the network instantiation**: Modified the `create_network` function to use the correct class name and adjusted parameter names (using `conv_lstm_features` instead of `convlstm_features`)\n3. **Preserved unused hyperparameters**: Kept the hyperparameter definitions intact even though some (dilation, bottleneck_ratio, head_hidden, steps) are not used by the actual network\
    \ class, as they may be used elsewhere in the training pipeline\n\nThe fixed code (v2) is now executing successfully in the evaluation system.\n\n**Important Note:** The debugger cannot modify files in your lineage storage. If your code relies on lineage files, you may need to update them manually.\n\n**Debugged Code (version v2):**\n```python\nimport sys\nsys.path.append('storage/zephyr')\nfrom ray import tune\nimport optax\n\n# Networks - Fixed import name\nfrom networks.cnn_convlstm_layernorm_twostream import CNNConvLSTM_LN_TwoStream\n\nBASE_SEED = 42\n\ndef _define_hyperparameters():\n    return {\n        'learning_rate': tune.choice([4e-4]),\n        'entropy_coef': tune.choice([0.01]),\n        'value_loss_coef': tune.choice([0.5]),\n        'cnn_features_1': tune.choice([32]),\n        'cnn_features_2': tune.choice([64]),\n        'convlstm_features': tune.choice([56]),   # compute-aware to keep ~39k updates\n        'dilation': tune.choice([6]),\n        'bottleneck_ratio':\
    \ tune.choice([0.26]),\n        'head_hidden': tune.choice([64]),\n        'steps': tune.choice([4]),\n    }\n\ndef create_network(hparams):\n    # Adapt to the actual class parameters\n    return CNNConvLSTM_LN_TwoStream(\n        cnn_features_1=int(hparams['cnn_features_1']),\n        cnn_features_2=int(hparams['cnn_features_2']),\n        conv_lstm_features=int(hparams['convlstm_features']),  # Fixed parameter name\n        # Note: The actual class doesn't use dilation, bottleneck_ratio, head_hidden, or steps\n        # These seem to be unused hyperparameters or for a different architecture\n    )\n\ndef create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 4e-4):\n    return optax.chain(optax.clip_by_global_norm(1.0), optax.adam(learning_rate))\n```\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n✓ Network\
    \ creation works\n✓ Network forward pass works - 3 outputs\n✓ Optimizer creation works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly!\n\nStarting full Ray training run...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 928 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  training_step: using default\n  create_optimizer: from submission\n  BASE_SEED: 42 (from submission)\n============================================================\n============================================================\nStarting Ray Tune Sokoban RL Optimization (FULL RAY TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 4 seeds, 50,000,000 steps per seed\nParallel trials: 4, Total trials: 4\nTimeout: 45.0 min per trial, 180.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune optimization...\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed\
    \ 4 with timeout 45.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M | 50.0M | 50.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | -0.70 | 2.53 | 3.63 | 3.12 | 4.64 | 5.19 | 6.66 | 9.79 | 10.87 | 9.55 | 5.59\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.167 | 0.222 | 0.150 | 0.273 | 0.308 | 0.444 | 0.688 | 0.769 | 0.667 | 0.333\n\nCompleted 39062 updates (1039s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.561\n\nSeed 4 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.561\nTraining time: 1052s\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 3 with timeout 45.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M | 50.0M | 50.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\
