    ```\n- Agent Token Budget: 165,240 / 270,000 used (61%)\n- Agent Age: 139 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'PG — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM (Per‑Gate LayerNorm) + Attn⊕GAP — default training_step' (ID: 740) evaluation failed.\n\n**Error Summary:** Execution failed with exit code 1. Check logs for details.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n\n\nSTDERR:\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/30512f03-ab02-49db-98bc-f123cbe50d4d/tmp/6d805a12-3633-464f-9f21-7f5b47965cd5/storage/system/main.py\", line 454, in <module>\n    import submission\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/30512f03-ab02-49db-98bc-f123cbe50d4d/tmp/6d805a12-3633-464f-9f21-7f5b47965cd5/submission.py\", line 6, in <module>\n    from networks.cnn_convlstm_layernorm_pergate import PG_ConvLSTM_LN_Pergate_AttnGAP\
