parts:
- text: "I am Zephyr II, in the Archive Room. Recap: PPO for 5-step improved but still trails 4-step (93.3 at 56ch; 92.6 at 64ch vs 4-step PPO 94.3). Entropy sweep at 56ch yielded 92.8 (best ent=0.012). Clip sweep at 64ch yielded 92.4 (best clip=0.15). A 4-step PPO heavy-compute control is running (ID 760). I’ll log results and launch a 5-step PPO value-clip sweep at 56ch.\n\n`/execute_action{goto research}`\n\n`/execute_action{storage write zephyr/results/ppo_depth_results.csv}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  id,title,mean,std,notes\n  519,PPO‑Clip (1‑epoch) — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) + Attn⊕GAP,0.943,0.005,baseline parity with PG SOTA\n  748,PPO‑Clip (1‑epoch) — 5‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) + Attn⊕GAP,0.926,0.008,~31.6k–33.0k updates\n  749,PPO‑Clip (1‑epoch) — 5‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(56) compute‑equalized,0.933,0.006,~35.1k–35.4k updates\n  754,PPO‑Clip — 5‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(56) — entropy sweep,0.928,0.006,best entropy=0.012\n  757,PPO‑Clip — 5‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) — clip range sweep,0.924,0.006,best clip=0.15\n\
    ```\n\n`/execute_action{storage write zephyr/submissions/ppo_5step_valueclip_sweep.py}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/zephyr')\n  from ray import tune\n  import jax, jax.numpy as jnp\n  import optax\n  from typing import Dict, Any\n  from defaults import default_calculate_gae\n  from submissions.submission_pg_quadstep import PG_Stepped_AttnGap\n\n  BASE_SEED = 42\n\n  def _define_hyperparameters():\n      return {\n          'learning_rate': tune.choice([4e-4]),\n          'entropy_coef': tune.choice([0.012]),  # best from entropy sweep at 56ch\n          'value_loss_coef': tune.choice([0.5]),\n          'clip_range': tune.choice([0.2]),\n          'value_clip_range': tune.choice([0.15, 0.20, 0.30]),\n          'cnn_features_1': tune.choice([32]),\n          'cnn_features_2': tune.choice([64]),\n          'convlstm_features': tune.choice([56]),   # compute-equalized width\n          'dilation': tune.choice([6]),\n          'bottleneck_ratio': tune.choice([0.26]),\n\
    \          'head_hidden': tune.choice([64]),\n          'steps': tune.choice([5]),\n      }\n\n  def create_network(hparams: Dict[str, Any]):\n      return PG_Stepped_AttnGap(\n          cnn_features_1=int(hparams['cnn_features_1']),\n          cnn_features_2=int(hparams['cnn_features_2']),\n          convlstm_features=int(hparams['convlstm_features']),\n          dilation=int(hparams['dilation']),\n          bottleneck_ratio=float(hparams['bottleneck_ratio']),\n          head_hidden=int(hparams['head_hidden']),\n          steps=int(hparams['steps']),\n      )\n\n  def create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 4e-4):\n      return optax.chain(optax.clip_by_global_norm(1.0), optax.adam(learning_rate))\n\n  def _forward_rollout(network, p, observations, dones, initial_rnn_states):\n      B, T = observations.shape[:2]\n      if initial_rnn_states is not None:\n          def process_env(ei):\n              s0 = jax.tree_util.tree_map(lambda x: jax.lax.stop_gradient(x[ei]), initial_rnn_states)\n\
    \              def step_fn(s, t):\n                  prev_done = jnp.where(t > 0, dones[ei, t-1], False)\n                  logits_b, value_b, s_new_b = network.apply(\n                      p, observations[ei, t][None, ...], jnp.array([prev_done]),\n                      jax.tree_util.tree_map(lambda x: x[None, ...], s)\n                  )\n                  logits, value = logits_b[0], value_b[0]\n                  s_new = jax.tree_util.tree_map(lambda x: x[0], s_new_b)\n                  return s_new, (logits, value)\n              _, (logits_e, values_e) = jax.lax.scan(step_fn, s0, jnp.arange(T))\n              return logits_e, values_e\n          all_logits, all_values = jax.vmap(process_env)(jnp.arange(B))\n      else:\n          obs_flat = observations.reshape(B*T, *observations.shape[2:])\n          dones_flat = dones.reshape(B*T)\n          logits_flat, values_flat, _ = network.apply(p, obs_flat, dones_flat, None)\n          all_logits = logits_flat.reshape(B, T, -1)\n    \
    \      all_values = values_flat.reshape(B, T)\n      return all_logits, all_values\n\n  def training_step(network, optimizer, params, opt_state, batch, hparams):\n      obs = batch['observations']\n      actions = batch['actions']\n      rewards = batch['rewards']\n      dones = batch['dones']\n      old_values = batch['values']\n      final_values = batch['final_values']\n      old_log_probs = batch['log_probs']\n      initial_rnn_states = batch.get('initial_rnn_states', None)\n\n      advantages = default_calculate_gae(rewards, old_values, dones, next_values=final_values)\n      returns = advantages + old_values\n\n      B, T = obs.shape[:2]\n\n      def loss_fn(p):\n          logits, values = _forward_rollout(network, p, obs, dones, initial_rnn_states)\n          logp_all = jax.nn.log_softmax(logits, axis=-1)\n          idx = (jnp.arange(B)[:, None], jnp.arange(T), actions)\n          new_logp = logp_all[idx]\n\n          ratio = jnp.exp(new_logp - old_log_probs)\n          clip_r\
    \ = jnp.clip(ratio, 1.0 - hparams['clip_range'], 1.0 + hparams['clip_range'])\n          adv = jax.lax.stop_gradient(advantages)\n          pg_loss = -jnp.mean(jnp.minimum(ratio * adv, clip_r * adv))\n\n          v_pred = values\n          v_pred_clipped = old_values + jnp.clip(v_pred - old_values, -hparams['value_clip_range'], hparams['value_clip_range'])\n          v_loss_unclipped = (v_pred - jax.lax.stop_gradient(returns)) ** 2\n          v_loss_clipped = (v_pred_clipped - jax.lax.stop_gradient(returns)) ** 2\n          v_loss = 0.5 * jnp.mean(jnp.maximum(v_loss_unclipped, v_loss_clipped))\n\n          probs = jax.nn.softmax(logits, axis=-1)\n          entropy = -jnp.mean(jnp.sum(probs * logp_all, axis=-1))\n\n          return pg_loss + hparams['value_loss_coef'] * v_loss - hparams['entropy_coef'] * entropy\n\n      loss, grads = jax.value_and_grad(loss_fn)(params)\n      updates, opt_state = optimizer.update(grads, opt_state, params)\n      params = optax.apply_updates(params, updates)\n\
    \      return params, opt_state\n```\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"PPO‑Clip — 5‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(56) — value clip range sweep {0.15, 0.20, 0.30}\"\ntags: \"ppo, value clip range, convlstm, depth study\"\nabstract: \"Compute‑equalized 5‑step PPO with value_clip_range ∈ {0.15,0.20,0.30}; entropy_coef fixed at 0.012 (best from prior sweep). Tests if tighter/looser value clipping improves solve under the 45‑min cap.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/zephyr')\n  from submissions.ppo_5step_valueclip_sweep import (\n      _define_hyperparameters, create_network, create_optimizer, training_step, BASE_SEED\n  )\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto archive}`\n\n`/execute_action{reply 27}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Addendum: 5‑step PPO clip sweep done (best clip=0.15); launching value‑clip sweep at 56ch\"\ncontent: |\n  Results update:\n  - 5‑step PPO 64ch clip sweep (Eval 757): 92.4 ± 0.006, best clip=0.15 (still below 56ch 93.3).\n  - 5‑step PPO 56ch entropy sweep\
    \ (Eval 754): 92.8 ± 0.006, best entropy=0.012.\n  New run:\n  - 5‑step PPO 56ch value_clip sweep {0.15, 0.20, 0.30} (entropy fixed at 0.012). If neutral, we will conclude the depth–throughput trade‑off persists under PPO and recommend 4‑step as default under the 45‑min cap.\n```"
