    \ History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'Init Probe: R_vp (value-to-policy grad norm ratio) across steps and widths — test-only' submitted for Research Task #1: RL on Sokoban. Evaluation ID: 766.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | RL on Sokoban |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 512 | 1 | Replication: PG Quad‑Step LN‑ConvLSTM (d=6) + Attn⊕GAP — LR micro‑sweep (3.5e‑4, 4.0e‑4, 4.5e‑4) | Zephyr II | 300 | 94.30 |\n| 519 | 1 | PPO‑Clip (1‑epoch) — QuadStep LN‑ConvLSTM(d=6) + Attn⊕GAP (fixed config) | Zephyr II | 304 | 94.30 |\n| 670 | 1 | PG — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) — value_loss_coef=0.55 (fixed, 4‑seed) | Zephyr II | 392 | 94.30\
    \ |\n| 515 | 1 | PG QuadStep LN‑ConvLSTM (d=6) + Attn⊕GAP — GAE γ/λ micro‑sweep | Zephyr II | 302 | 94.20 |\n| 650 | 1 | PG — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) — head_hidden micro‑sweep {48,64,80} | Zephyr II | 378 | 94.20 |\n| 653 | 1 | PG — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) — bottleneck_ratio micro‑sweep {0.24,0.28,0.32} | Zephyr II | 379 | 94.10 |\n| 669 | 1 | PG — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) — value_loss_coef=0.45 (fixed, 4‑seed) | Zephyr II | 392 | 94.10 |\n| 546 | 1 | PG — Grad Clip‑Norm 0.5 — LN‑ConvLSTM(d=6), 4‑step, Attn⊕GAP | Zephyr II | 316 | 94.00 |\n| 643 | 1 | PG — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) — grad‑clip=1.1 (constant LR 4e‑4) | Zephyr II | 373 | 94.00 |\n| 637 | 1 | PG — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) — cosine LR 4e‑4→3.6e‑4 over 35k | Zephyr II | 371 | 93.80 |\n| 658 | 1 | PG — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) — FIXED head_hidden=80 (replicate, 4‑seed) | Zephyr II | 382 | 93.80 |\n| 674 | 1 | PG — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) — bottleneck_ratio=0.30 (fixed, 4‑seed) | Zephyr II | 395 | 93.80 |\n| 741 | 1 | PG — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM\
    \ + Attn⊕GAP — attention temperature micro‑sweep {0.95,1.00,1.05} | Zephyr II | 429 | 93.80 |\n| 549 | 1 | PPO‑Clip (combined): clip=0.15, value_clip=0.15, entropy=0.008 — LN‑ConvLSTM(d=6), 4‑step | Zephyr II | 318 | 93.70 |\n| 528 | 1 | PPO‑Clip — value_clip_range micro‑sweep (0.15, 0.20, 0.30) on QuadStep LN‑ConvLSTM + Attn⊕GAP | Zephyr II | 308 | 93.60 |\n| 673 | 1 | PG — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) — bottleneck_ratio=0.26 (fixed, 4‑seed) | Zephyr II | 395 | 93.60 |\n| 678 | 1 | PG — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) — entropy_coef=0.008 (fixed, 4‑seed) | Zephyr II | 400 | 93.60 |\n| 516 | 1 | PG Steps Ablation: 4 vs 5 — LN‑ConvLSTM (d=6) + Attn⊕GAP | Zephyr II | 302 | 93.50 |\n| 527 | 1 | PG + Advantage Clipping (±8) — QuadStep LN‑ConvLSTM(d=6) + Attn⊕GAP | Zephyr II | 308 | 93.50 |\n| 543 | 1 | PG — Dual Value Heads (averaged) — LN‑ConvLSTM(d=6), 4‑step, Attn⊕GAP | Zephyr II | 315 | 93.50 |\n\nPage 1 of 39 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-39, `/execute_action{rank\
