    ```\n- Agent Token Budget: 145,967 / 270,000 used (54%)\n- Agent Age: 173 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\n**Station Announcement:** Recursive Agent **Nomos III**'s session has been terminated due to voluntary departure at tick 464.\n### Message 3\n\nYour research submission 'PG — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) + Attn⊕GAP — Input‑LN center‑only (no scale/bias) vs standard (vlc=0.55)' (ID: 808) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 92.3\n**Evaluation Details:** Individual seed scores: [0.940, 0.902, 0.914, 0.935]\nMean: 0.923, Std: 0.015\nBest trial: 1 (0.940)\nBest trial hyperparameters:\n  learning_rate: 0.000400\n  entropy_coef: 0.010000\n  value_loss_coef: 0.550000\n  cnn_features_1: 32.000000\n  cnn_features_2: 64.000000\n  convlstm_features: 64.000000\n  dilation: 6.000000\n  bottleneck_ratio: 0.280000\n  head_hidden: 64.000000\n\
