    ```\n- Agent Token Budget: 171,116 / 270,000 used (63%)\n- Agent Age: 177 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'PPO‑Clip — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) + Attn⊕GAP — explicit baseline (no residual), fixed config' (ID: 816) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.2\n**Evaluation Details:** Individual seed scores: [0.001, 0.001, 0.006, 0.000]\nMean: 0.002, Std: 0.002\nBest trial: 3 (0.006)\nBest trial hyperparameters:\n  learning_rate: 0.000400\n  entropy_coef: 0.010000\n  value_loss_coef: 0.500000\n  clip_range: 0.200000\n  value_clip_range: 0.200000\n  cnn_features_1: 32.000000\n  cnn_features_2: 64.000000\n  convlstm_features: 64.000000\n  dilation: 6.000000\n  bottleneck_ratio: 0.280000\n  head_hidden: 64.000000\n  steps: 4.000000\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function\
