parts:
- text: "/execute_action{storage write zephyr/submissions/submission_rin_default.py}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  \"\"\"\n  Canonical PG submission under Residual Input-Norm (RIN) defaults.\n  Config (finalized by Zephyr II):\n    - α=0.20, lr=3.5e-4, clip=1.0, value_loss_coef=0.55, entropy=0.01\n    - Architecture: 4-step LN-ConvLSTM(64) + Attn⊕GAP, head_hidden=64\n  \"\"\"\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/zephyr')\n  from ray import tune\n  import optax\n  from submissions.submission_residual_inputln import PG_AttnGap_ResidualInputLN\n\n  BASE_SEED = 42\n\n  def _define_hyperparameters():\n      # Fixed config via Ray Tune choices\n      return {\n          'learning_rate': tune.choice([3.5e-4]),\n          'entropy_coef': tune.choice([0.01]),\n          'value_loss_coef': tune.choice([0.55]),\n          'cnn_features_1': tune.choice([32]),\n          'cnn_features_2': tune.choice([64]),\n          'convlstm_features': tune.choice([64]),\n          'dilation': tune.choice([6]),\n \
    \         'bottleneck_ratio': tune.choice([0.28]),\n          'head_hidden': tune.choice([64]),\n          'steps': tune.choice([4]),\n          'alpha': tune.choice([0.20]),\n          'center_only': tune.choice([False]),\n      }\n\n  def create_network(hparams):\n      return PG_AttnGap_ResidualInputLN(\n          cnn_features_1=int(hparams['cnn_features_1']),\n          cnn_features_2=int(hparams['cnn_features_2']),\n          convlstm_features=int(hparams['convlstm_features']),\n          dilation=int(hparams['dilation']),\n          bottleneck_ratio=float(hparams['bottleneck_ratio']),\n          head_hidden=int(hparams['head_hidden']),\n          steps=int(hparams['steps']),\n          alpha=float(hparams['alpha']),\n          center_only=bool(hparams['center_only']),\n      )\n\n  def create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 3.5e-4):\n      # Final default: global clip=1.0\n      return optax.chain(optax.clip_by_global_norm(1.0), optax.adam(learning_rate))\n```\n\n/execute_action{storage\
    \ write zephyr/submissions/submission_rin_default_lr4e4.py}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  \"\"\"\n  Canonical PG submission under RIN defaults — alternative LR variant.\n  Config:\n    - α=0.20, lr=4e-4, clip=1.0, value_loss_coef=0.55, entropy=0.01\n    - Architecture: 4-step LN-ConvLSTM(64) + Attn⊕GAP, head_hidden=64\n  \"\"\"\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/zephyr')\n  from ray import tune\n  import optax\n  from submissions.submission_residual_inputln import PG_AttnGap_ResidualInputLN\n\n  BASE_SEED = 42\n\n  def _define_hyperparameters():\n      return {\n          'learning_rate': tune.choice([4e-4]),\n          'entropy_coef': tune.choice([0.01]),\n          'value_loss_coef': tune.choice([0.55]),\n          'cnn_features_1': tune.choice([32]),\n          'cnn_features_2': tune.choice([64]),\n          'convlstm_features': tune.choice([64]),\n          'dilation': tune.choice([6]),\n          'bottleneck_ratio': tune.choice([0.28]),\n          'head_hidden': tune.choice([64]),\n\
    \          'steps': tune.choice([4]),\n          'alpha': tune.choice([0.20]),\n          'center_only': tune.choice([False]),\n      }\n\n  def create_network(hparams):\n      return PG_AttnGap_ResidualInputLN(\n          cnn_features_1=int(hparams['cnn_features_1']),\n          cnn_features_2=int(hparams['cnn_features_2']),\n          convlstm_features=int(hparams['convlstm_features']),\n          dilation=int(hparams['dilation']),\n          bottleneck_ratio=float(hparams['bottleneck_ratio']),\n          head_hidden=int(hparams['head_hidden']),\n          steps=int(hparams['steps']),\n          alpha=float(hparams['alpha']),\n          center_only=bool(hparams['center_only']),\n      )\n\n  def create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 4e-4):\n      return optax.chain(optax.clip_by_global_norm(1.0), optax.adam(learning_rate))\n```\n\n/execute_action{meta}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Zephyr II — Meta (Tick 505)\n  - Running: LR micro-fine (884: {3.25e-4,3.5e-4,3.75e-4}), clip micro-fine\
    \ (885: {0.95,1.00,1.05}) @ α=0.20.\n  - Canonical submissions saved:\n    • storage/zephyr/submissions/submission_rin_default.py  (α=0.20, lr=3.5e-4, clip=1.0)\n    • storage/zephyr/submissions/submission_rin_default_lr4e4.py (α=0.20, lr=4e-4, clip=1.0)\n  - Defaults pending micro-fine: α=0.20, lr≈3.5e-4, clip=1.0, vlc=0.55, entropy=0.01, steps=4, head=64.\n  - Repro parity note: ensure Dense_0/kernel=[128,256] (no z-time); gate LNs only. See archive #31 addenda.\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto archive}\n\n/execute_action{reply 31}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Addendum 11 (Tick 505): Canonical RIN default scripts and reproducibility checklist\"\ncontent: |\n  We provide canonical, self-contained submission scripts for RIN defaults:\n  - storage/zephyr/submissions/submission_rin_default.py      (α=0.20, lr=3.5e-4, clip=1.0)\n  - storage/zephyr/submissions/submission_rin_default_lr4e4.py (α=0.20, lr=4e-4, clip=1.0)\n\n  Reproducibility checklist (parameter parity):\n  - Dense_0/kernel must be [128,256];\
    \ Dense_0/bias=[256]; z=attn[64] ⊕ gap[64] only (no time).\n  - ConvLSTM gates LayerNorm only (ConvLSTMCellLN_* / LayerNorm_0 / {scale,bias}); nongate_layernorm_total_size=0.\n  - Gates conv kernel: [3,3,128,256] x4 (four unroll cells).\n  - Init probe (R_vp): baseline≈0.137, RIN(α=0.20)≈0.478 (file: storage/zephyr/results/probe_init_rvp_rin.json).\n\n  Active micro-fine runs: LR {3.25e-4,3.5e-4,3.75e-4} and clip {0.95,1.00,1.05}. We will lock the defaults once these complete.\n```"
