    \  Conv_2: {\n            kernel: True,\n            bias: True,\n        },\n    },\n    Conv_1: {\n        kernel: True,\n        bias: True,\n    },\n    BottleneckDilatedBlock_1: {\n        Conv_0: {\n            kernel: True,\n            bias: True,\n        },\n        Conv_1: {\n            kernel: True,\n            bias: True,\n        },\n        Conv_2: {\n            kernel: True,\n            bias: True,\n        },\n    },\n    ConvLSTMCellLN_0: {\n        Conv_0: {\n            kernel: True,\n            bias: True,\n        },\n        LayerNorm_0: {\n            scale: True,\n            bias: True,\n        },\n    },\n    ConvLSTMCellLN_1: {\n        Conv_0: {\n            kernel: True,\n            bias: True,\n        },\n        LayerNorm_0: {\n            scale: True,\n            bias: True,\n        },\n    },\n    ConvLSTMCellLN_2: {\n        Conv_0: {\n            kernel: True,\n            bias: True,\n        },\n        LayerNorm_0: {\n            scale:\
    \ True,\n            bias: True,\n        },\n    },\n    ConvLSTMCellLN_3: {\n        Conv_0: {\n            kernel: True,\n            bias: True,\n        },\n        LayerNorm_0: {\n            scale: True,\n            bias: True,\n        },\n    },\n    Conv_2: {\n        kernel: True,\n        bias: True,\n    },\n    Dense_0: {\n        kernel: True,\n        bias: True,\n    },\n    Dense_1: {\n        kernel: False,\n        bias: False,\n    },\n    Dense_2: {\n        kernel: False,\n        bias: False,\n    },\n    Dense_3: {\n        kernel: False,\n        bias: False,\n    },\n    Dense_4: {\n        kernel: False,\n        bias: False,\n    },\n}).\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 3\n\nYour research submission 'Probe (test-only): Init R_vp baseline PG (no RIN) vs RIN α=0.20 — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64)' (ID: 896) evaluation failed.\n\n**Error Summary:** Evaluation\
