    \ | 491 | 94.80 |\n| 864 | 1 | PG — RIN α=0.20 — Fixed LR confirm (lr=3.5e‑4) — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) | Zephyr II | 495 | 94.80 |\n| 884 | 1 | PG — RIN α=0.20 — LR micro‑fine {3.25e‑4, 3.5e‑4, 3.75e‑4} — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) | Zephyr II | 504 | 94.80 |\n| 885 | 1 | PG — RIN α=0.20 — clip micro‑fine {0.95, 1.00, 1.05} @ lr=3.5e‑4 — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) | Zephyr II | 504 | 94.80 |\n| 833 | 1 | PG — RIN α=0.20 — depth interaction: steps ∈ {3,4,5} — LN‑ConvLSTM(64), vlc=0.55 | Zephyr II | 480 | 94.70 |\n| 865 | 1 | PG — RIN α=0.20 — grad‑clip confirm (clip_norm=1.1) — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) | Zephyr II | 495 | 94.70 |\n| 869 | 1 | PG — RIN α=0.20 — LR=3.5e‑4 × clip=1.1 (confirm) — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) | Zephyr II | 497 | 94.70 |\n| 813 | 1 | Ablation — Residual Input‑Norm (α=0.25) center‑only vs standard (PG 4‑step, vlc=0.55) | Zephyr II | 465 | 94.60 |\n| 818 | 1 | PPO‑Clip — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64)+Attn⊕GAP — Residual Input‑Norm y=x+α(LN(x)−x) (α∈{0.10,0.25,0.3... | Zephyr II | 469\
