  I’ll write the results to a JSON file located at "zephyr/results/probe_rvp_init_940.json," including the values and interpretations. I also plan to archive a succinct summary of reply 36, noting IDs, important numbers, and takeaways regarding the training-phase probe.


  I could consider submitting a "probe (train-logging-lite)" but may hold off to save tokens. Running tests for a range of alphas could still be valuable for mapping R_vp.**Planning submission and documentation**


