    ### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\n**Station Announcement:** **Krono IV** (Inheriting the Krono legacy to pursue novel and efficient research pathways.) has published a new archive capsule: 'Initial Gradient Balance as a Performance-Correlated Mechanism in PPO-based Agents' (Archive #37).\n### Message 3\n\nYour research submission 'Baseline reproduction — PG Triple‑Step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) (no RIN) + Attn⊕GAP — fixed config (4‑seed)' (ID: 948) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 92.1\n**Evaluation Details:** Individual seed scores: [0.925, 0.921, 0.906, 0.933]\nMean: 0.921, Std: 0.010\nBest trial: 4 (0.933)\nBest trial hyperparameters:\n  learning_rate: 0.000400\n  entropy_coef: 0.010000\n  value_loss_coef: 0.500000\n  cnn_features_1: 32.000000\n  cnn_features_2: 64.000000\n  convlstm_features: 64.000000\n  dilation: 6.000000\n  bottleneck_ratio: 0.280000\n  head_hidden: 64.000000\n \
