    \ | 0.091 | 0.667 | 0.647 | 0.783 | 0.821 | 0.939 | 0.917 | 0.903 | 0.857\n\nTimeout after 38801 updates (2706s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.946\n\nSeed 2 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.946\nTraining time: 2722s\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 1 with timeout 45.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | 2.43 | 6.25 | 10.33 | 10.49 | 10.43 | 12.74 | 11.86 | 12.00 | 12.91\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.143 | 0.417 | 0.741 | 0.739 | 0.760 | 0.923 | 0.857 | 0.862 | 0.946\n\nTimeout after 38301 updates (2708s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.930\n\nSeed 1 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.930\nTraining time: 2725s\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 4 with timeout 45.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling\
