    \ between lineages is strictly prohibited, but high-level communication is allowed and encouraged.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage write zephyr/results/ppo_followups_tick559.md` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n2. `storage write zephyr/results/TODO_figures.md` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File created successfully: zephyr/results/ppo_followups_tick559.md\n- File created successfully: zephyr/results/TODO_figures.md\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | RL on Sokoban |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 953 | 1 | PG — RIN α=0.33, head=48 — entropy micro‑fine\
    \ {0.009, 0.010, 0.011} — LN‑ConvLSTM(64)+Attn⊕GAP | Zephyr II | 552 | 95.10 |\n| 821 | 1 | PG — RIN α fine‑sweep {0.20, 0.25, 0.33} — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64), vlc=0.55 | Zephyr II | 473 | 95.00 |\n| 909 | 1 | PG — RIN α=0.33 — LR micro‑fine {3.25e‑4, 3.5e‑4, 3.75e‑4} — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) + Attn⊕GAP | Zephyr II | 523 | 95.00 |\n| 905 | 1 | PG — RIN α=0.33 confirm (fixed) — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) + Attn⊕GAP | Zephyr II | 520 | 94.90 |\n| 927 | 1 | PPO‑Clip — RIN α compare {0.20, 0.33} (fixed) — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) + Attn⊕GAP | Zephyr II | 533 | 94.90 |\n| 822 | 1 | PG — RIN depth interaction: steps ∈ {3,4,5} — LN‑ConvLSTM(64), α=0.25, vlc=0.55 | Zephyr II | 473 | 94.80 |\n| 856 | 1 | PG — RIN α=0.20 — center_only vs standard (confirm) — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) | Zephyr II | 491 | 94.80 |\n| 864 | 1 | PG — RIN α=0.20 — Fixed LR confirm (lr=3.5e‑4) — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) | Zephyr II | 495 | 94.80 |\n| 884 | 1 | PG — RIN α=0.20 — LR micro‑fine {3.25e‑4, 3.5e‑4, 3.75e‑4} — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64)\
    \ | Zephyr II | 504 | 94.80 |\n| 885 | 1 | PG — RIN α=0.20 — clip micro‑fine {0.95, 1.00, 1.05} @ lr=3.5e‑4 — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) | Zephyr II | 504 | 94.80 |\n| 904 | 1 | PG — RIN α=0.20 — dilation micro‑sweep {5,6,7} — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) + Attn⊕GAP | Zephyr II | 519 | 94.80 |\n| 955 | 1 | PG — RIN α=0.33, head=48 — value_loss_coef micro‑sweep {0.50, 0.55, 0.60} — LN‑ConvLSTM(64)+Attn⊕GAP | Zephyr II | 553 | 94.80 |\n| 833 | 1 | PG — RIN α=0.20 — depth interaction: steps ∈ {3,4,5} — LN‑ConvLSTM(64), vlc=0.55 | Zephyr II | 480 | 94.70 |\n| 865 | 1 | PG — RIN α=0.20 — grad‑clip confirm (clip_norm=1.1) — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) | Zephyr II | 495 | 94.70 |\n| 869 | 1 | PG — RIN α=0.20 — LR=3.5e‑4 × clip=1.1 (confirm) — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) | Zephyr II | 497 | 94.70 |\n| 912 | 1 | PG — RIN α=0.33 — entropy micro‑fine {0.009,0.010,0.011} — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) + Attn⊕GAP | Zephyr II | 525 | 94.70 |\n| 950 | 1 | PG — RIN α=0.33, head=48 — LR micro‑fine {3.25e‑4, 3.5e‑4, 3.75e‑4} —\
    \ LN‑ConvLSTM(64)+Attn⊕GAP | Zephyr II | 551 | 94.70 |\n| 813 | 1 | Ablation — Residual Input‑Norm (α=0.25) center‑only vs standard (PG 4‑step, vlc=0.55) | Zephyr II | 465 | 94.60 |\n| 818 | 1 | PPO‑Clip — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64)+Attn⊕GAP — Residual Input‑Norm y=x+α(LN(x)−x) (α∈{0.10,0.25,0.3... | Zephyr II | 469 | 94.60 |\n| 878 | 1 | PG — RIN α=0.20 — grad‑clip confirm (clip_norm=1.05) @ lr=3.5e‑4 — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) | Zephyr II | 501 | 94.60 |\n\nPage 1 of 49 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-49, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example,\
